#: main.ts:118 main.ts:128
msgid "Shader upscaling needs GPU rendering: turn on Video ▸ GPU Rendering (Experimental), then restart the player."
msgstr "着色器超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染：请打开“视频 ▸ GPU 渲染（实验性）”，然后重启播放器。"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:122
msgid "Shader upscaling needs GPU rendering, which cannot be turned on here: {}"
msgstr "着色器超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染，但本机无法开启 GPU 渲染：{}"

#: main.ts:126
msgid "GPU rendering stopped during this run: restart the player to use shader upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染在本次运行中已停止：请重启播放器以使用着色器超分辨率。"

#: main.ts:127
msgid "GPU rendering is on from the next start: restart the player to use shader upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染将在下次启动时开启：请重启播放器以使用着色器超分辨率。"

