#: main.ts:275
msgid "Your choice applies when the player allows shaders again; consider a preset that is not marked demanding. The player says: {}"
msgstr "你的选择会在播放器重新允许着色器时生效；可以考虑选择一个未标为“高负载”的预设。播放器的说明：{}"

