#: upscale.slint:204
msgid "Shaders run on the GPU while the picture is drawn: only with GPU rendering, and exported videos and pictures do not contain them. If playback stutters, choose a preset that is not marked demanding."
msgstr "着色器在绘制画面时于 GPU 上运行：仅在 GPU 渲染下生效，导出的视频和图片不包含其效果。如果播放卡顿，请选择未标为“高负载”的预设。"

#: upscale.slint:210
msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"
